Your luck will _slowly_ time out (i.e. be reduced to zero) and you
have not the extra luck bonus (of 3 pts., IIRC). You may compensate
the decreasing luck by throwing precious gems to coaligned unicorns
from time to time, but I suppose it's easier to get it by the next
chance. With reduced luck some things get slightly worse as time
proceeds, so depending on how confident you feel you may want to get
the stone earlier or later.

